{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0hvbGx5d29vZC8yMDAwLS0yMDEwL0NvbnZpY3Rpb24lMjAlMjgyMDEwJTI5Lw","type":"movie","name":"Conviction","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/rUxznyFz7D0HgC5zcYigzP1XUi4.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/tT8xjbKPHxz9T37fWM3ohlHP3TW.jpg","description":"When Betty Anne Waters' older brother Kenny is arrested for murder and sentenced to life in 1983, Betty Anne, a Massachusetts wife and mother of two, dedicates her life to overturning the murder conviction. Convinced that her brother is innocent, Betty Anne puts herself through high school, college and, finally, law school in an 18 year quest to free Kenny. With the help of best friend Abra Rice, Betty Anne pores through suspicious evidence mounted by small town cop Nancy Taylor, meticulously retracing the steps that led to Kenny's arrest. Belief in her brother - and her quest for the truth - pushes Betty Anne and her team to uncover the facts and utilize DNA evidence with the hope of exonerating Kenny.\n\nRated R · Released 15 Oct 2010 · United States of America · Language: English · 107 min\nStudio: Pantheon Entertainment Corporation, Omega Entertainment, Longfellow Pictures\n\nOn your server — Audio: English","releaseInfo":"2010","genres":["Drama","Hollywood"],"imdbRating":"7.1","imdb_id":"tt1244754","moviedb_id":45094,"tmdbId":45094,"runtime":"107 min","cast":["Hilary Swank","Sam Rockwell","Minnie Driver","Melissa Leo","Peter Gallagher","Ari Graynor","Loren Dean","Conor Donovan"],"director":["Tony Goldwyn"],"writer":["Pamela Gray"],"released":"2010-10-15T00:00:00.000Z","slogan":"An extraordinary journey of how far we go to fight for our family.","country":"United States of America","language":"English","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Tony Goldwyn","character":"Director","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/A3hXimbzDtFxQ1PXNo8gG7RZeN4.jpg"},{"name":"Hilary Swank","character":"Betty Anne Waters","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1